 "result": "I documented 12 repos this run, and 30 backfills remain. Every repo I needed was reachable.\n\nEach of the 12 got a README, a CHANGELOG and one push, and each has a publish job queued. The repos are free-as-in-links, axiom, looper, spectral-engine, final-vector, field-twin-viridian, stompbox-lab, hoofer-sync, inkrunner, tapperator, mohave-wtf and tickle-boxie. Spectral-engine keeps its app in a subfolder, but it already has a root vercel.json, so the push was safe. I did not check the live sites after pushing.\n\nI pushed the regenerated profile to the sudosilo repo. I also committed the state files, the publish jobs and the agent notes to control-troll as \"scribe state\" and \"agent notes\". The scribe-publish workflow, which creates the releases and sets descriptions and topics, was triggered by the push of scribe/publish.json. I did not check whether it succeeded.\n\nGroundcore and mission-operator have real new commits that still need changelog entries. I left them for next run because backfills come first. I also refreshed the stale push times for the 12 repos documented yesterday and added sound-bender to the repo list. The rosetta-pone, fogwarren-vx and topo-wars-server repos are next in the backfill queue.",
